menu "ToDoHelper: voice service"

    config TODOHELPER_VOICE_HTTP_TIMEOUT_MS
        int "ASR / TTS request timeout (ms)"
        range 5000 120000
        default 30000
        help
            Cloud speech endpoints can be slow; the request runs in this
            component's task so the UI stays responsive.

    config TODOHELPER_VOICE_SAVE_PCM
        bool "Save each recording to storage"
        default y
        help
            Writes <storage>/todohelper/ai/rec_<timestamp>.pcm so a recording can
            be inspected or replayed. Raw 16 kHz / 16-bit / mono, no WAV header.

    config TODOHELPER_VOICE_KEEP_PCM
        int "Number of recordings kept on storage"
        range 0 50
        default 5
        help
            0 disables saving. Older files are not deleted automatically yet;
            see docs/API.md 已知限制.

endmenu
